The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.


Short description
-----------------

spinning1:

 Spinning problem of a Newtonian fluid (Stokes)
 Axisymmetrical flow.

spinning2:

 Viscoelastic spinning problem
 Axisymmetrical flow for a Giesekus model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration

spinning3:

 Viscoelastic spinning problem
 Axisymmetrical flow for an XPP model
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 second-order Gear time integration

